2026-07-26T10:37:40.3429445Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:37:40.3430726Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:37:40.3431685Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
